  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎么会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我们明明只消灭了一个整合运动小队......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "还顺势摁倒了一个大块头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "这个才是重头戏好吗，为了对付他，我可是累坏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那么多感染者，怎么可能消失的无影无踪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "刚才那个大家伙，只是打个掩护而已？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动在这么短的时间里撤出了这个区域？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不，陈长官理应截断了他们的后路——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我看不到信息点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "这里......不对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "杂草，废墟，沙丘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "全是值得埋伏的地点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "但我，什么都看不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "脚印，服饰刮擦植物的声音，爆炸物特有的气息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我没法判断！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "企鹅快递的家伙，打起精神来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "一切都不对劲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "收声！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "是什么声音......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "————嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "是从......地下！？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "阿米娅！从地下传来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "博士！！快趴下！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这群人......真是不择手段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "————！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "怎么......你居然......能挡住？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这面“般若”，可不是你能打得穿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "那可......未必......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "温度急剧升高！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他想引爆手中的魔杖吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "博士！快跑！那个距离，你会————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "结束了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不......不要———"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能—————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不可以伤害博士———————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......很厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咳......好疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明有这种力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......就甘......心......看着同胞们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能，原谅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原谅你们这种......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "不...........不要............."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
